{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THAT AMAZING RTS FEEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubic Annihilation is a fast, unforgiving RTS where every choice matters. No macro spam. No safety nets. Just sharp positioning, fast decisions, and raw tactical execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/ee09c75a84277fcc6b47731570f4f353.poster.avif?t=1767055005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/ee09c75a84277fcc6b47731570f4f353.webm?t=1767055005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/ee09c75a84277fcc6b47731570f4f353.mp4?t=1767055005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN FACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each match, craft your <strong>Loadout</strong> by choosing a unique mix of units, structures, and modifiers. Your choices define your entire strategy \u2014 no tech trees, no mid-match unlocks. Just pure RTS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead. Commit. Execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hope your opponents didn\u2019t blind-counter you. :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/2e3319cd31b3f2faa7477d746ee73e87.poster.avif?t=1767055005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/2e3319cd31b3f2faa7477d746ee73e87.webm?t=1767055005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/2e3319cd31b3f2faa7477d746ee73e87.mp4?t=1767055005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT DOMAIN WILL YOU MASTER?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubic Annihilation features 4 types of traversing the battlefield:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ground</strong> units form the backbone of your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Air</strong> units bring mobility and constant pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea</strong> units dominate aquatic maps with powerful long-range firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hovercraft</strong>\u00a0can move across both land and sea, trading raw power for speed and flexibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/25c3c70f47de12abebfd2a823d4d1105.poster.avif?t=1767055005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/25c3c70f47de12abebfd2a823d4d1105.webm?t=1767055005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/25c3c70f47de12abebfd2a823d4d1105.mp4?t=1767055005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the world of Cubic Annihilation. Discover why you\u2019re fighting, uncover what was taken from you, and take it back. Battle across hostile planets, complete dangerous missions, and claim powerful spoils to upgrade your loadout. The mercenaries won\u2019t stop themselves \u2014 only you can bring them down\u2026 for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/81b3717cde711e35b2c24c497423ee51.poster.avif?t=1767055005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/81b3717cde711e35b2c24c497423ee51.webm?t=1767055005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/extras/81b3717cde711e35b2c24c497423ee51.mp4?t=1767055005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While multiplayer is not the 100% focus of Cubic Annihilation, you can still face off against other players in 1v1 or team-based multiplayer battles. Test your strategies, refine your loadouts, and stay sharp, because every match brings something new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLING VS AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a <strong>1v1 duel against the AI</strong> and sharpen your skills. Pick your challenge from four distinct difficulties \u2014 <strong>Easy, Medium, Hard, and Cheater</strong>. Start simple, push your limits, or face the ultimate unfair fight where the rules bend against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU READY TO COMMAND YOUR CUBES?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubic Annihilation is a no-nonsense tactical RTS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive army variety. Hard choices. No wasted moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your loadout. Upgrade your units. Spend your resources \u2014 and outplay everyone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397060?t=1767055005","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/175bd62fb7993a80b60bb0299fbdd0b9cecf4877/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767055005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397060/69ea0c8e2d6c110bde16b98960800ff37e5c0fa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767055005","capsule_imagev5":"https://sh